  {
   "idx": 3,
   "zh": "中共中央政治局常委李强、王沪宁、蔡奇、丁薛祥出席座谈会。李强受中共中央委托通报了上半年经济工作有关情况，介绍了关于下半年经济工作有关考虑。",
   "en": "Xi Jinping, general secretary of the CPC Central Committee, presided over the symposium and delivered an important speech. He stressed that to do a good job in economic work in the second half, it is necessary to adhere to the general principle of pursuing progress while ensuring stability, fully and faithfully apply the new development philosophy on all fronts, and move faster to create a new pattern of development. He urged efforts to maintain policy continuity and stability while enhancing flexibility and foresight, keep employment, businesses, markets and expectations stable, effectively bolster consumption, break free from \"rat race\" competition, facilitate domestic economic circulation, and promote the positive interplay between domestic and international economic flows, so that the annual objectives and targets for economic and social development can be accomplished to bring the 14th Five-Year Plan to a successful conclusion.",
   "kind": "para",
